WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
Even Earth wobbles.

2
00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:06.270
As the Moon goes round, Earth
swings in a small loop of its own.

3
00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:11.580
Far away, a star does the same,
tugged by a planet nobody can see.

4
00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:14.850
Star and planet circle
a shared balance point,

5
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:17.230
always on opposite sides of it.

6
00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:20.780
How can the star's wobble
reveal the planet's mass?

7
00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:24.730
In this mission, you'll find the
balance point of Earth and the Moon.

8
00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:29.010
Then you'll work out the period
that two orbiting bodies share.

9
00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:33.720
Your mission: explain how the star's
wobble reveals the planet's mass.
